        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么，其中的安全风险也是大家要注意的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.469,
      "end": 13.086,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "尤其是对孩子来讲，那种安全威胁呢就更大。",
      "score": 0.0762,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0087,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0063,
        "sc_delta": 0.0024,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "尤其是对于买家来讲，那种安全威胁呢，就更大。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.304,
      "end": 16.336,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "啷子能够有效的预防溺水事故？",
      "score": 0.2639,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1519,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1308,
        "sc_delta": 0.0212,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.144,
        "seg_cer": 0.231,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "子/只",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "哪只能够有效地预防溺水事故？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.336,
      "end": 22.355,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "遇到溺水又应该啷个搞呢？今天我给大家分享一些一些儿童防溺水的攻略。",
      "score": 0.059,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0483,
        "sc_logprob": -0.044,
        "sc_delta": 0.0042,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.129,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "遇到泥水，又应该啷个搞呢？今天啊，我和大家分享一些一些儿童防泥水的攻略。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 22.621,
      "end": 25.982,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在夏天来了，好多小白呢都喜欢去游泳、",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0397,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0446,
        "sc_delta": -0.0049,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "现在夏天来了，好多小白呢都喜欢去游泳。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 25.982,
      "end": 31.201,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "耍水来降温避暑。那么儿童溺水事故呢也进入一个高发期。",
      "score": 0.0781,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0306,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0346,
        "sc_delta": -0.004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.083,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "耍",
        "text_free": "刷水来降温避暑，那么儿童溺水事故呢？也进入了一个高发期。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 31.401,
      "end": 36.282,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "四岁的儿童溺水高发地点主要是家中的蓄水容器，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0047,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0045,
        "sc_delta": 0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "四岁的儿童溺水高发地点，主要是家中的蓄水容器。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 36.282,
      "end": 38.599,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "比方讲水缸、浴盆。",
      "score": 0.3571,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1271,
        "sc_logprob": -0.142,
